        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="Hn 93.37" corresp="#wit-lat"><pb n="610" ed="#liebermann"/>Qui aliquem in collo plagiauerit, ut incuruationem uel inflexibilitatem uel inde perpetuam<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="32" target="#Hn_93-37.lnote.oe.32"/> contrahat egritudinem, et tamen uiuat ita<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="2" target="#Hn_93-37.lnote.oe.2"/> contumeliatus, C sol. emendetur<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="9" target="#Hn_93-37.lnote.oe.9"/> et quicquid in medicatura<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="f" target="#Hn_93-37.lnote.oe.f"/> fuerit erogatum<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="33" target="#Hn_93-37.lnote.oe.33"/>, nisi sapientum estimacio<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="34" target="#Hn_93-37.lnote.oe.34"/> amplius iudicauerit.</ab>
